WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.307
Scroll down on the Dashboard to the Fulfilment section.

00:00:03.758 --> 00:00:09.435
It follows your goods: ordered, dispatched from India, in transit, and delivered to John Deere.

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:14.115
Click a number, for example In transit, to see the orders behind it.

00:00:14.568 --> 00:00:19.061
Close the list, and try Pending to dispatch: what we still have to send.
